    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of a stranger who has fallen into a mysterious magical formation. By using simple mathematics to solve puzzles, they progress through the game's seven challenging levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control the character to interact with mechanisms and collect energy. Meeting specific <strong>numerical conditions</strong> activates teleportation portals, allowing progression to the next level. Observe <strong>mathematical patterns</strong> and <strong>connections between numbers</strong> to unlock pathways.</p>",
